BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Hall Fletcher Elementary
X-SOURCE-URL:https://hallfletcher.ashevillecityschools.net/calendar
DTSTAMP:20260801T034608Z
UID:41e964d3-1266-5901-b303-90b5487c834e
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240914T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240914T153000
DESCRIPTION:Join us next Saturday 9/14 for the15th annual West Asheville
  Garden Stroll! 10:30 kickoff program at Lucy Herring Elementary\, 98 S
 ulphur Springs Road (enter from Harnett Street) with sing-alongs\, info 
 tables\, and an introduction to Bountiful Cities' FEAST program and the w
 onderful Lucy Herring Peace Garden.Stroll Guides available at the school
  from 11-3:30.15 diverse gardens featuring:permaculture designsan “alm
 ost English garden”medicinal plants &amp\; all kinds of edibleswater fe
 atures &amp\; unique arborsshade &amp\; sun gardensChihuly-style glass ar
 tThe Hop ice cream cartWhether you're a seasoned gardener or just starting
  out\, you'll come away inspired and enjoy meeting friendly &amp\; knowled
 geable gardeners.As always\, WAGS is a free community event\, rain or shin
 e.Please leave furry friends at home -- dogs are not allowed in the garde
 ns.westashevillegardens.comfacebook.com/WestAshevilleGardens
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:West Asheville Garden Stroll
END:VEVENT
